Package: dataraft.core
Title: Core Components for DataRaft
Version: 0.1.0.9002
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Prepare repeated data deliveries, check their columns and quality
    rules, and inspect failures before writing any output. Reusable products,
    recipes and workflows work in memory and connect to optional storage,
    transformation and catalog adapters through public S3 interfaces.
